section\":\"repo://stdo-v3.0.2-source/PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#pc-04--recursive-authority-and-information-eligibility\",\"start_line\":917}],\"kind\":\"authority_boundary\",\"meaning\":\"Recursive use applies the existing edge authorities without transitive widening.\"},\"scope\":[\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:scope:source-corpus\"],\"source\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:9cf5abaccc2c192f2b63905987f18afc\",\"target\":\"urn:a-c:generation:630ce49ea536c4b3949b529c:record:740591d30370a65f48fcebfec32179ad\"}"
}

